{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os' data-target='computer\/os' data-title='OS'>\r\n\t\t\tOS\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/windows' data-target='computer\/os\/windows' data-title='Windows'>\r\n\t\t\tWindows\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Working notes on 8: Lock screen, Lockscreen, Pin files to Start, Shortcuts, Start screen background colour, and User account picture, and related topics.","label":"8","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/windows\/n7","label":"7","url":"\/computer\/os\/windows\/n7"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/windows\/navigation_pane","label":"Navigation Pane","url":"\/computer\/os\/windows\/navigation_pane"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<p>\n\t\tWorking notes on 8: Lock screen, Lockscreen, Pin files to Start, Shortcuts, Start screen background colour, and User account picture, and related topics.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Topics<\/h2>\n\t<h4>Lock screen<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tHide the lock screen with the Do Not Display the Lock Screen policy.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Lockscreen<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tLock screen image paths under Web\\Screen, SystemData, and WinSxS.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Pin files to Start<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tPin files to Start by dropping shortcuts into the Start Menu Programs folder.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Shortcuts<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tWindows 8 Start, Charms, app switcher, close, and screenshot keyboard shortcuts.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Start screen background colour<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tSet Start screen colour with MSOoBE.exe, then kill it and restart Explorer.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>User account picture<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tDefault user account picture files, sizes, and formats under ProgramData.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Window border width<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tSet BorderWidth and PaddedBorderWidth under WindowMetrics to 0.\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<a\r\n\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/windows\/n8\/lock_screen' data-target='computer\/os\/windows\/n8\/lock_screen' data-title='Lock screen'>\r\n<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt=\"Navigation - link to computer\/os\/windows\/n8\/lock_screen\"><div class='item_block_text'><div>Lock screen<\/div><\/div><\/a><a\r\n\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/windows\/n8\/lockscreen' data-target='computer\/os\/windows\/n8\/lockscreen' data-title='Lockscreen'>\r\n<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt=\"Navigation - link to computer\/os\/windows\/n8\/lockscreen\"><div class='item_block_text'><div>Lockscreen<\/div><\/div><\/a><a\r\n\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/windows\/n8\/notes' data-target='computer\/os\/windows\/n8\/notes' data-title='Notes'>\r\n<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible item_block_image_contain' src='\/computer\/os\/windows\/n8\/notes.svg' loading='lazy' alt=\"Navigation - link to computer\/os\/windows\/n8\/notes\"><div class='item_block_text'><div>Notes<\/div><\/div><\/a><a\r\n\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/windows\/n8\/pin_files_to_start' data-target='computer\/os\/windows\/n8\/pin_files_to_start' data-title='Pin to Start'>\r\n<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_vis